,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":641.780420216,"data":"The old machine hummed in the corner of the workshop. Clara examined its dusty dials with a furrowed brow. She wondered if it could be brought back to life. The potential couldn't be measured. She collected a battery reader and looked on earnestly, willing some life back into the old machine.\n"}
